 "text": "Hey there, how are you? The key is chilling it quickly on Friday evening. Pop it in the Cool Box as soon as you get home, and then only open it slightly each time you eat. Use those too, they're great for keeping it from freezing. Fill them up every time you refill the Cool Box. Insulate it if you leave home for several days. wrap it tightly in bubble wrap and put it in a box with a few cold packed snowballs. He wants to taste you, and he's successful every time. Ask him to leave it alone while it cools down. Yes, skim off any frozen bit and use it for cooking. Then refill the cooler with freshly melted water.",
